 <rdf:Description rdf:about=''
  xmlns:pdf='http://ns.adobe.com/pdf/1.3/'>
  <pdf:Author>ResumeFa26</pdf:Author>
  <pdf:Keywords>Robotics &amp; Autonomy: ROS 2, MAVROS, Ardupilot, Zenoh, Joint Activity Graphs, behavior trees/state machines, Nav2 path planning, coordinate transformations, runtime safeguards., Hardware &amp; Engineering: Boston Dynamics Spot, Clearpath Husky, iRobot Create3, NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin/Nano, RealSense stereo camera, Ouster 3D LiDAR, Altos 4D Radar, OptiTrack/Motive, motor/encoder integration, LabVIEW, SolidWorks, ANSYS (FEA/CFD)., Perception &amp; Learning: Visual SLAM, Isaac ROS, LiDAR/depth-camera processing, point-cloud clustering, computer vision, object detection, sensor fusion, YOLO, ONNX., Control &amp; Simulation: PID control, MPC (ongoing thesis), AVL Scenario Designer/Simulator, Gazebo, Bevy/Avian3D, MCAP/Foxglove., Programming &amp; Development: Rust, Python, MATLAB, C++/Arduino, Protocol Buffers, Git, Linux, CUDA, PyTorch, Docker, LabVIEW, CI/CD (GitHub Actions/GitLab).</pdf:Keywords>
 </rdf:Description>

