  <rms:rms_education_0_description>Honors College Scholar, President&#39;s List, Allen E. Paulson Scholar, Tau Beta Pi
Honors thesis (in progress): When to Trust Learned Lead-Vehicle Predictions: Reliability-Gated Preview for Safety- Supervised Adaptive Cruise Control.
Relevant coursework: Mechatronics, Mechanism Design, Machine Design, Dynamics, Mechanics of Materials, Measurement &amp; Instrumentation Lab, Vehicle Design and Testing, Numerical Methods, Differential Equations, Calculus Iâ€“III, Program Design, Circuit Analysis, Logic Circuit Design, FEA, and Engineering Research.</rms:rms_education_0_description>
