  <rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>Present</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_description>Integrated ROS 2 visual SLAM, navigation, and behavior-tree mission logic on Jetson/RealSense hardware for indoor UAV research; measured 14.5 cm localization RMSE during a 110-second cart test over valid reference intervals.
Developed a LiDAR-based hand-motion interface for UAV guidance, using point-cloud clustering and trajectory mapping to translate operator movements into robot commands.
Investigating reliability-gated lead-vehicle prediction for safety-supervised model predictive adaptive cruise control; established a MATLAB/AVL PD commissioning baseline and designed matched comparisons of physical and learned preview.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>true</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_location>Statesboro, GA</rms:rms_experience_0_location>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_role>Undergraduate Student Researcher</rms:rms_experience_0_role>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_company>National Center for Collaborative Autonomy, Institute for Human &amp; Machine Cognition</rms:rms_experience_1_company>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>May 2026</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1777593600</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>August 2026</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1785542400</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_description>Architected and developed a modular, distributed Rust/Python autonomy platform for heterogeneous robot teams, integrating multi-agent decision-making, capability-based task allocation, and hardware-agnostic interfaces.
Built physics-based simulation and hybrid digital twins with motion-capture integration, distributed state sharing, command validation, geofencing, and runtime safeguards for sim-to-real evaluation.
Validated multi-robot collection-and-delivery missions in 10+ hardware trials with two Boston Dynamics Spot robots; tested Clearpath Husky integration and implemented cross-platform CI/CD.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_location>Pensacola, FL</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_role>Collaborative Robotics Autonomy Intern</rms:rms_experience_1_role>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_company>CARISSMA Institute of Safety in Future Mobility</rms:rms_experience_2_company>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>July 2025</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>1751328000</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>August 2025</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>1754006400</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_description>Designed and constructed a truck-rear soft crash target for multimodal pre-crash testing, supporting research on early collision detection and occupant protection.
Analyzed LiDAR and 4D-radar measurements to assess target detectability across covering and reflector configurations; supported experimental setup, data acquisition, and vehicle testing.
Preparing a first-author manuscript on soft-target design and validation, combining sensor-technology literature review with analysis of field-test data.</rms:rms_experience_2_description>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_location>Ingolstadt, Germany</rms:rms_experience_2_location>
  <rms:rms_experience_2_role>Vehicle Testing Research Intern</rms:rms_experience_2_role>
