  <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndTS>1722470400</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_3_description>Implemented hybrid mission-autonomy software in Python/ROS 2 for UAVs, combining finite-state-machine transition guards with reactive behavior trees using py_trees.
Compared legacy state-machine, behavior-tree, and hybrid implementations; benchmarked execution time and analyzed lines of code to characterize implementation tradeoffs.
Verified mission sequencing and emergency interruption in Fraunhofer&#39;s in-house flight simulator; documented the architecture, evaluation methods, and test results.</rms:rms_experience_3_description>
