  <rms:rms_summary>Mechanical Engineering Honors student focused on the design, hardwareâ€“software integration, and experimental validation of autonomous robotic systems, spanning mechanical hardware, sensing and actuation, embedded computing, and autonomy software. Research experience includes distributed autonomy architectures, multi-agent coordination, and robotic perception, with interests in learning-based control, motion planning, and decision-making under uncertainty.</rms:rms_summary>
